### 上传单个文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/single
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

< ./test.txt

###

### 上传多个文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/multiple
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

< ./file1.txt
< ./file2.txt

###

### 上传带内容的文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

< ./test.txt

Hello, World!

###

### 上传文件并附加表单数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/with-data
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是文件的描述信息
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

document
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

test,upload,example
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./document.pdf
--boundary--

###

### 上传JSON数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "上传的JSON数据",
  "data": {
    "field1": "value1",
    "field2": "value2"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "uploadedBy": "{{username}}",
    "timestamp": "{{$timestamp}}"
  }
}

###

### 上传XML数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/xml
Content-Type: application/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<upload>
  <file>
    <name>test.xml</name>
    <content>示例XML内容</content>
  </file>
  <metadata>
    <uploadedBy>{{username}}</uploadedBy>
    <timestamp>{{$timestamp}}</timestamp>
  </metadata>
</upload>

###

### 大文件上传（流式）
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/stream
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
Transfer-Encoding: chunked

这里是二进制文件内容...

###

### 分块上传 - 初始化
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/chunk/init
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "large-file.zip",
  "totalSize": 10485760,
  "chunkSize": 1048576,
  "totalChunks": 10
}

> {%
client.test("初始化分块上传", function() {
  client.assert(response.status === 200);
  client.assert(response.body.uploadId);
  client.global.set("uploadId", response.body.uploadId);
});
%}

###

### 分块上传 - 上传第一个分块
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/chunk/{{uploadId}}/1
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

这是第一个分块的数据内容...

###

### 分块上传 - 完成上传
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/upload/chunk/{{uploadId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadId": "{{uploadId}}",
  "totalChunks": 10
}